B.MX=new A.cK("Player",B.Tz)
B.WH=s(["Nothing... apart from a face.","A young man with dark hair and cold eyes. He wore a naval coat finer than any officer's, with a golden lion at his collar.","He looked at me as though he knew me. Then everything went dark."],t.s)
B.Mn=new A.cq("Watch Mateo's reaction","intro_mateo_recognizes_prince",!0,!1)
B.Wk=s([B.Mn],t.u)
B.Np=new A.cc(B.ag,B.WH,null,null,null,B.Wk)
B.VQ=s([B.Np],t.J)
B.MY=new A.cK("Player",B.VQ)
B.Te=s(["That sounds like the Prince of Britain.","The British Navy has been cracking down hard on piracy. If you crossed paths with the prince himself, they may have taken you for a pirate.","But the crown calls everyone a criminal when it suits them. The government is corrupt, and poverty has spread across the nation while the powerful line their own pockets.","Many people down on their luck have turned to piracy simply to make ends meet. For some, it is the only way left to put food on the table."],t.s)
B.dI=s([],t.u)
